cff-version: 1.2.0
title: HAIStack
message: If you use HAIStack or its research artefacts, please cite this software.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Degoke
repository-code: "https://github.com/degoke/HAIStack"
url: "https://github.com/degoke/HAIStack"
abstract: >-
  Health AI Stack (HAIStack) is a collection of modular Go libraries for
  building FHIR-native health data infrastructure with safe AI access.
  This citation covers the software and the vendor-neutral research artefacts
  under research/ (benchmarks, semantic-conversion corpora, policy semantics,
  terminology evaluation, and the reproducible FHIR to AI pipeline).
keywords:
  - FHIR
  - SMART on FHIR
  - SQL-on-FHIR
  - health informatics
  - clinical AI
  - provenance
  - terminology
